---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Rooklet: Make a little room for your day | Lauren Leppert"
description: Rooklet is a day-planning app for tasks, habits, meals, and movement. Capture now and plan when you’re ready. Try the beta on iOS or Android.
---
<main id="main-content" tabindex="-1">
  <div class="ll-detail-top ll-wrap">
    <a href="/#apps">Back to my apps</a>
  </div>
  <section class="ll-app-hero ll-wrap">
    <div>
      <div class="ll-app-brand">
        <img src="/images/apps/rooklet-icon.png" alt="" width="45" height="45">Rooklet <span class="ll-status">In beta</span>
      </div>
      <h1>Make a little room for your day.</h1>
      <p>A planning app for capturing tasks and deciding what belongs in your day. Give something a rough week or month, pick an exact date, or leave it unplanned until you’re ready. Habits, meals, and movement can sit alongside your plans. You choose which parts to use.</p>
      <div class="ll-actions">
        <a class="ll-primary" href="#ios-beta">Try the iOS beta</a>
        <a class="ll-primary" href="#android-beta">Try the Android beta</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ll-app-stage">
      <figure class="ll-phone">
        <img src="/images/apps/rooklet-today-2026-09-15.jpg" alt="Rooklet’s Today view, with a daily plan and example tasks" width="660" height="1434">
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="ll-app-points ll-wrap">
    <div>
      <h2>Capture it first.</h2>
      <p>Put a task somewhere you can return to, without deciding every detail.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2>Plan roughly, or exactly.</h2>
      <p>Give something a week or a month when that’s all you know. Choose a day when you’re ready.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2>Choose your day.</h2>
      <p>Choose what belongs in today’s plan. When something is unfinished, you can add it to today, plan another time, or let it go.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="beta" class="ll-beta ll-wrap" aria-labelledby="beta-title">
    <div class="ll-section-head">
      <h2 id="beta-title">Try the Rooklet beta.</h2>
      <p>Choose your platform to get started.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ll-beta-platforms">
      <section id="ios-beta" class="ll-beta-platform" aria-labelledby="ios-beta-title">
        <h3 id="ios-beta-title">iOS</h3>
        <p class="ll-beta-service">Through Apple TestFlight</p>
        <a class="ll-primary" href="{{ iosBeta.joinUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Join the iOS beta</a>
        <ol class="ll-beta-steps">
          <li>Install <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/testflight/id899247664">TestFlight</a> on your iPhone or iPad.</li>
          <li>Open <a href="{{ iosBeta.joinUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Rooklet’s invitation</a> in TestFlight.</li>
          <li>Accept the invitation and tap Install.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>
      <section id="android-beta" class="ll-beta-platform" aria-labelledby="android-beta-title">
        <h3 id="android-beta-title">Android</h3>
        <p class="ll-beta-service">Through Google Play</p>
        <a class="ll-primary" href="{{ androidBeta.groupUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Join the Android beta</a>
        <ol class="ll-beta-steps">
          <li><a href="{{ androidBeta.groupUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Join the tester group</a> with the Google account you use in Google Play.</li>
          <li><a href="{{ androidBeta.joinUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Become a tester</a> on Google Play using that same account.</li>
          <li><a href="{{ androidBeta.storeUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Rooklet on Google Play</a> and install it.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="ll-contact ll-wrap">
    <div>
      <h2>Built by Lauren.</h2>
      <p>Rooklet is in beta and still taking shape. I’m happy to hear your questions or thoughts.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ll-actions">
      <a class="ll-textlink" href="/">Meet Lauren</a><a class="ll-primary" href="mailto:{{ appEmail }}?subject=Rooklet">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
